================================================================================
AUTHORING RULES - 5. Placement context.md
================================================================================
Purpose: say WHERE `<{{componentName}}>` goes in a view, what sits around it
         and what it holds. The reader is an AI agent composing a view:
         `get_component` of the MCP server returns it, with the rules it
