                               what `npm run check.usage-docs` verifies in CI.
  - docs/agents/patterns/    - the domains of the design language (actions,
                               widths, surfaces, titles...) whose rules this
                               file cites by id.

MAY contain (up to five headings, in this exact order, each a list):
  1. "#### Where it goes": the places in a view, the width, how many in one view.
  2. "#### Not here": the places it does not go, with where instead.
  3. "#### Around it": what sits before, after and beside it (the title, the
